flowchart LR
  U[Authenticated IT user] --> UI[Fixed-height Fred chat]
  UI --> S[(Durable per-user session)]
  UI --> H[Topic browser and archive]
  H --> S
  UI --> ACTIVE[Protected active incident state]
  UI --> API[Fred API]
  ACTIVE --> API
  API --> R{Workload profile}
  R -->|routine: direct OpenAI| T[GPT-5.6 Terra]
  R -->|deep: direct OpenAI| C[GPT-5.6 Sol]
  R -->|verify: direct OpenAI| V[GPT-5.6 Terra]
  R -->|non-OpenAI model| OR[OpenRouter ZDR gateway]
  OR --> X[Claude or Gemini when ZDR-qualified]
  T --> TOOLS[Typed live evidence tools]
  DB[(Switches, buildings, VLANs, links, ports, phones, routing, configs)] --> GEN[Architecture generator]
  CIO[CIO Dashboard architecture button] --> GEN
  UI -->|explicit as-is architecture request| GEN
  GEN --> C
  DB --> APP[Deterministic complete inventory appendices]
  C --> D[As-is architecture + Mermaid]
  APP --> D
  D --> V
  V --> REVIEW[Acceptance review]
  GEN --> JSON[(Versioned architecture JSON snapshots)]
  JSON --> ENT[(Normalized architecture entities)]
  JSON --> REL[(Normalized architecture relationships)]
  CHATFIX[(Attributed CIO chat corrections)] --> ENT
  ENT -->|bounded record query| API
  REL -->|dependency traversal| API
  D --> JSON
  REVIEW --> JSON
  JSON -->|bounded domain/query retrieval| API
  API --> M[(Team and personal governed memory)]
  API --> F[(Fred file library)]
  TOOLS --> API
  M --> API
  F --> API
